From af59789546b2c181c986e6ae7a9360892e02e209 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nckrtl <nick.retel@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 21:23:32 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Sweep UpCloud and refresh its template nightly while the
 token file is set

The host sweep now runs whenever the UpCloud token file is set, also with
task VMs off; the Incus hosts are swept only while task VMs are enabled.
RefreshUpCloudTaskVmTemplate builds a new template every night at 02:00 on
the template queue, once a first verified template exists.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
